<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2066" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθῡμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be disheartened, despond</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς νόσον πεσὼν ἀθυμεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					474
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴμ᾽ ὡς ἀθυμῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					587
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ τινι</span>. <i>at</i> or
				<i>for</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				769
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					264b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν παροῦσαν ὄψιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.88
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τελευτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.91
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο, ὡς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					8.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕνεκά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.4.19
				</span></i>
			:—<i>to be sore afraid</i> lest, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθυμῶ δ᾽ εἰ φανήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					666
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινῶς ἀθυμῶ μὴ βλέπων ὁ μάντις ᾖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					747
				</span></i>
			.</div>
